Session timers (RFC 4028) for the t48timer module, issue #77, docs/sip.md.

baresip has no session timers. From a call the module needs the message
that set it up (the INVITE of an incoming call, the 2xx of an outgoing
one), its SIP session (to send refreshes in its dialog), a way to set its
custom headers (baresip keeps call_set_custom_hdrs internal), and those
headers on the 2xx that answers an incoming call (Session-Expires).

